    "turn_text": "I note that you, even though you've only been in the House since 2005, are really a veteran Democrat on the House Ag Committee. What have you and other Democrats been doing to bring these freshmen, or at least just in the second term, Congresspersons, up to speed on writing a new farm bill?",
