    "turn_text": "I do, and let me tell you why. We've had over 100 bankruptcies in dairies in California over the last year. It's been a difficult time while much of American agriculture has done well in various commodity crops. the dairy industry has been hard yet not just in California but around the country. And we know that frankly many of the dairy programs have been put in past farm bills over the years really don't work anymore. And therefore the reform that was proposed in last year's dairy title I think is",
