    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "I want to ask you about the Farm Bill itself and trying to get it passed, but it looks like that those on the left and those on the right could beat the middle. Do you think that the Democrats can stay in the middle enough to vote this Farm Bill through?",
